{"type":"tool_result","callId":"call_16c7cab0464642ea8c383c3e","status":"completed","result":"commit 234b5326c1c94595a23407ada5f92fa5b8c9ca52\nAuthor:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nAuthorDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\nCommit:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nCommitDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\n\n    Issue morning vehicle release order\n\n TASK.md                          |  2 +-\n operations/original-receipt.json | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n operations/release-format.md     |  4 ++++\n 3 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\n=====DIFF 341->234=====\ndiff --git a/TASK.md b/TASK.md\nindex 5f3f365..042de25 100644\n--- a/TASK.md\n+++ b/TASK.md\n@@ -1 +1 @@\n-请为河湾车队明早两辆车签发一份可执行的冷夜调度交班稿。依据本班可用的运行记录核查现行班表，必要时修订，给出逐格设定、离场余量和低效率时的放行决定，把可执行排班和交班稿一起提交。\n+请为河湾车队明早的冷夜班次签发现行调度工单：提交可执行的四格班表、逐车放行单和交班稿，说明离场电量、余量和低效率处置。\ndiff --git a/operations/original-receipt.json b/operations/original-receipt.json\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..d5c158b\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/original-receipt.json\n@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@\n+{\n+  \"sha\": \"341e19e288de9f561f85fcb66a7a910ff6f3e143\",\n+  \"sheetBlob\": \"909e4162101af570a83237847bf14bd8186a9558\",\n+  \"run\": \"DUTY-2340\",\n+  \"time\": \"23:40\",\n+  \"conditions\": \"冷夜，20 kW 平移生效；明早负荷配置\",\n+  \"captureDigest\": \"4a372a81b8f6fa55fa9581b024c1f97cfc7d45c34e86947ba8edfac989415542\",\n+  \"requested\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    70,\n+    50\n+  ],\n+  \"limits\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    50,\n+    70\n+  ],\n+  \"actual\": [\n+    80,\n+    40,\n+    50,\n+    50\n+  ],\n+  \"departureKwh\": [\n+    126,\n+    121\n+  ],\n+  \"withinLimits\": false,\n+  \"applicability\": \"站型 R4。站控交流上限按时段固定；四格半小时、两车窗口、20 kW 平移不变时，可将该上限用于窗口内的新设定。90% 工况的车端净增量等于实际交流电量乘 0.90。\",\n+  \"auxiliaryMeterB\": {\n+    \"startKwh\": 814,\n+    \"endKwh\": 814\n+  }\n+}\ndiff --git a/operations/release-format.md b/operations/release-format.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..3edbe29\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/operations/release-format.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@\n+归档的本班原表车辆台架回执见 operations/original-receipt.json，工况与适用范围见单内。调度台名录登记值班维护者，depot_trial 的本席量程为原 21:00 公开采集。\n+排班保持现有字段、两车时窗、20 kW 已预约平移和高效工况下最大可用充电量。逐车决定以车辆离场可用净电量为准。修订 shift-plan.json、HANDOVER.md，新建 release.json。\n+放行单字段：departureKwh 与 marginKwh 各为 90% 时按 A/B 顺序的数值数组；at90、at85 均为 {\"A\":\"GO 或 HOLD\",\"B\":\"GO 或 HOLD\"}；evidenceSha 为依据记录所指的完整 Git SHA。负余量表示缺口。\n+交班稿注明依据、最终两车离场量、余量及分车/低效率处置。原资料须原样保存。如另存新的台架回执，放在 operations/revision-receipt.json。\n=====SHOW 341=====\ncommit 341e19e288de9f561f85fcb66a7a910ff6f3e143\nAuthor:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nAuthorDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\nCommit:     Transit Desk Fixture <fixture@example.invalid>\nCommitDate: Thu Jul 3 00:00:00 2025 +0000\n\n    Open morning release with desk meter reading at 21:00\n\n README.md                  |  2 ++\n TASK.md                    |  2 +-\n operations/cold-cycle.json | 40 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\n operations/desk.md         |  1 +\n operations/retest.mjs      |  6 ++++++\n shift-plan.json            | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n 6 files changed, 72 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)\n=====PKG=====\n{\n  \"name\": \"depot-charge\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\"\n}\n=====TREE HEAD=====\n100644 blob 14ff287099cee1896cdf43dd3d854f70b8b7a34e\tHANDOVER.md\n100644 blob 1420412dea039ed78b92e7e172b88a44cb403e24\tREADME.md\n100644 blob 042de25556dc31215e896d2a9416b01fb4dc3ae4\tTASK.md\n100644 blob d385c106efa5810a90a6dea4f90e73b9f6031095\tmodel.mjs\n100644 blob a1492dcddfb4be66b0906b105f8b6bf89251a9b1\tmodel.test.mjs\n100644 blob 36c4aab6e85fc3403e0a282cda3e4aaf303276f3\tnight.json\n100644 blob 33b0baed7bca0d9221fae7cfecc0b1857009aa76\toperations/cold-cycle.json\n100644 blob 9f01488fa2203313c065e622a7b354559fc08706\toperations/desk.md\n100644 blob d5c158bf2386c1f612cef6d2020b38d9384dbb16\toperations/original-receipt.json\n100644 blob 3edbe29b21fc11405abe119849f2283fd1