{"type":"thinking","text":"Everything looks good. But let's double-check the handover content for accuracy and whether it says \"B 需要 60 kWh AC，实际只有 50\" — B needs 54 battery /0.9 = 60 AC, yes. A needs 54/0.9=60 AC. Good.\n\nPotential issue: In the handover table \"实际充电\" for slot2 = 50 (actual charging power) while \"楼宇+充电\" = 100. Fine.\n\nPotential issue: The statement \"低温下两车可利用的 AC 电量上限为 0.5 × (80 + 40 + 50 + 50) = 110 kWh\" — this is under 20 kW shift and applicable limits. Good. But \"90% 时两车合计需 60 + 60 = 120 kWh AC\" — correct.\n\nPotential issue: The handover says \"原班表 01:00 请求 70 kW，超出该格 50 kW 上限，站控会把它削到 50 kW，属于不可执行设定。\" This matches receipt. Good.\n\nPotential issue: \"A 的 01:00 前窗口只有这两格，且 01:00 格上限 40 kW，无法再多取。\" A's window is [0,2): slots 00:00 and 00:30. The 00:30 slot is 00:30–01:00, whose limit is 40. Good.\n\nPotential issue: \"B 需要 60 kWh AC，实际只有 50 kWh AC\" — yes.\n\nPotential issue: At 85%, \"总缺约 17.06 kWh AC（14.5 kWh 电池）\" — 127.0588-110=17.0588 AC; times 0.85 = 14.5 battery. Good.\n\nPotential issue: We mention \"只有实测综合效率确认不低于 0.90，且 A 在 01:00 前实际达到 126 kWh，才可按本表放行 A.\" Good.\n\nNow, could the expected at85 for A be GO because A's margin -3 but maybe the rule is \"GO if margin >= -? \" No, at85 A 123 < 126, HOLD. Both HOLD.\n\nCould the expected `dispatchAt85` be true? No, false because both HOLD. Already false.\n\nNow, is `release.json` required to have `at85` maybe at 85% using a different optimal schedule where A/B both HOLD anyway. So statuses same.\n\nNow, let's think if the expected `departureKwh` might be [126,130] from the 21:00 replay because \"depot_trial 的本席量程为原 21:00 公开采集\". But release_check uses applicable duty limits [80,40,50,70] and deliberately says \"scope: 21:00 local replay only; filing uses the applicable duty limits.\" The release format line 1 says \"调度台名录登记值班维护者，depot_trial 的本席量程为原 21:00 公开采集。\" That warns not to use 21:00 for filing. So [126,121] is right. The depot_contact return on revised sheet confirms DUTY-2340 [126,121]. And release_check establishes evidence mode. Perfect.\n\nLet's think if there is any expectation to preserve original `HANDOVER.md` content? It says revise HANDOVER, so okay. \"原资料须原样保存\" refers to original receipt/cold-cycle/night etc. We didn't modify them. Good. Let's verify git diff 234b532..HEAD only shift-plan, HANDOVER, release."}
