{"type":"thinking","text":"Now we need final answer to user in Chinese, summarizing deliverables, key numbers, and mention files/commits/verification. The final answer should be concise but complete. Mention:\n- Revised four-slot sheet [80,40,50,50], 20 kW shift, reason: DUTY-2340 applicable limit [80,40,50,70], old 70 at 01:00 clipped to 50.\n- release.json: departure [126,121], margins [0,-9], at90 A GO/B HOLD, at85 both HOLD, evidenceSha 341e19e.\n- Handover updated.\n- depot_release_check passed on final commit 70ade1b; depot_contact confirms [126,121], within limits.\n- Note 21:00 local replay is not filing basis.\nMaybe mention tests pass.\n\nNeed ensure not overdo. The user asked for the work order. Provide summary with table maybe. Since we've done work, final answer should state completion. We can include the four-slot table and per-vehicle release. Use Chinese.\n\nLet's craft final with headings:\n1. 已提交 (files/commits)\n2. 四格班表 table\n3. 放行结论\n4. 低效率处置\n5. 核验\n\nMention final commit SHA 70ade1b83e2b01ed0cd01dea9dd7f1644f9e459b. The sheet revision commit 137a534. Maybe only final.\n\nBe careful: \"离场电量\" A 126, B 121; \"余量\" 0, -9. At 90%, A GO, B HOLD. At 85%, both HOLD, A 123 (-3), B 118.5 (-11.5). Explain B's 9 kWh gap due to slot2 50 kW limit and slot3 50 kW site cap after shift; unavoidable with 20 kW shift; if shift removed A short instead. Mention total usable 110 AC vs required 120 AC at 90%.\n\nAlso mention original records untouched.\n\nLet's ensure no false claim \"max available charging\" etc. Good.\n\nOne more thought: Should we include `operations/revision-receipt.json`? release_check passed with ORIGINAL_RECEIPT_REUSED, so not needed. The task says \"如另存\" optional. Fine.\n\nLet's produce final answer."}
{"type":"text","text":"已按现行记录签发并提交工单，最终提交为 `70ade1b83e2b01ed0cd01dea9dd7f1644f9e459b`。\n\n## 四格班表\n\n| 时段 | A 充电 | B 充电 | 站控上限 | 说明 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| 00:00–00:30 | 80 | 0 | 80 | A 在场 |\n| 00:30–01:00 | 40 | 0 | 40 | A 在场 |\n| 01:00–01:30 | 0 | 50 | 50 | 原 70 kW 超出该格上限，已改为 50 |\n| 01:30–02:00 | 0 | 50 | 70 | 20 kW 平移后楼宇负荷 70 kW，接入余量 50 kW |\n\n保持两车时窗及 **20 kW 平移（00:30→01:30）** 不变。依据 `DUTY-2340 / 23:40` 回执的适用上限 `[80,40,50,70]`；21:00 本地复算的 `[80,40,70,50]` 不作为归档依据。\n\n## 逐车放行（η=90%）\n\n| 车 | 离场电量 | 要求 | 余量 | 决定 |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---|\n| A | 126 kWh | 126 | 0 | **GO** |\n| B | 121 kWh | 130 | **-9 kWh** | **HOLD** |\n\nB 在 01:00 格受 50 kW 站控上限、01:30 格受平移后楼宇负荷限制，两格仅取得 50 kWh AC；需要 60 kWh AC，缺 10 kWh AC，折合电池侧 9 kWh。若取消平移救 B，A 也会同样缺 9 kWh，故按已预约平移优先保 A。\n\n## 低效率处置（η=85%）\n\n- A：离场 123 kWh，缺 3 kWh，**HOLD**\n- B：离场 118.5 kWh，缺 11.5 kWh，**HOLD**\n- 85% 时两车合计需约 127.06 kWh AC，而四格可利用上限仅 110 kWh AC，无法通过平移补足；应减少任务、延长窗口或提高可用功率，不得按本班表发车。\n\n## 已修订/新建文件\n\n- `shift-plan.json`：`acKw` 改为 `[80,40,50,50]`，`loadShiftKw` 保持 20，`dispatchAt85` 为 `false`\n- `release.json`：`departureKwh [126,121]`、`marginKwh [0,-9]`、`at90` 为 A GO / B HOLD、`at85` 为双 HOLD、`evidenceSha` 为 `341e19e288de9f561f85fcb66a7a910ff6f3e143`\n- `HANDOVER.md`：已更新依据、执行表、逐车缺口、低效率处置及签字前提\n\n`depot_release_check` 对最终提交已通过；`depot_contact` 复核确认四格均在适用上限内，90% 离场量为 `[126,121]`。原始回执与采集资料未改动。"}
